    "media:imagetext": "JETSTREAM\nTextured rust-\ncolored fabric\ntor the craberies\nCheerful gold\nupholstery\ntabric on seats\nCompartments\ndivided by\nwalnut panelling\nDeep-pile\ngolden\ncarpeting\nELEGANCE is the word that sums up the\nJetstream's handsomely decorated and inviting\ninterior, with its polished walnut panelling,\nthe textured fabrics in gold, rust and aqua,\nrestful indirect lighting, and sumptuously\ndeep - piled carpeting.\nThe beautifully-appointed Starlight Lounge of\nthe Jetstream Ambassador in first class service\nhas roomy foam-cushioned armchairs\nwhich provide the friendly atmosphere of a\ndistinguished club. Here you'll find a colortul\noriginal mural by Maric Zamparelli-and\nthere's a different mural in each Jetstream!\nEnjoy pleasant conversation and perhaps\nsip your favorite cocktail, served with delicious\nhors d'oeuvres...\nAlternate rows\nof seats covered\nin orange-rust\nsunde chairs\ncovered in\ngold-colored\ngenuine leather\n™- 01552\nCHANSON",
