    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "JETSTREAM\nTextured rust-\ncolored fabric\ntor the craberies\nCheerful gold\nupholstery\ntabric on seats\nCompartments\ndivided by\nwalnut panelling\nDeep-pile\ngolden\ncarpeting\nELEGANCE is the word that sums up the\nJetstream's handsomely decorated and inviting\ninterior, with its polished walnut panelling,\nthe textured fabrics in gold, rust and aqua,\nrestful indirect lighting, and sumptuously\ndeep - piled carpeting.\nThe beautifully-appointed Starlight Lounge of\nthe Jetstream Ambassador in first class service\nhas roomy foam-cushioned armchairs\nwhich provide the friendly atmosphere of a\ndistinguished club. Here you'll find a colortul\noriginal mural by Maric Zamparelli-and\nthere's a different mural in each Jetstream!\nEnjoy pleasant conversation and perhaps\nsip your favorite cocktail, served with delicious\nhors d'oeuvres...\nAlternate rows\nof seats covered\nin orange-rust\nsunde chairs\ncovered in\ngold-colored\ngenuine leather\n™- 01552\nCHANSON",
      "LUXURIOUS\nELEGANT\nDEPENDABLE\nHere's air travel as you dreamed it\ncould be-and it's yours to enjoy\nnow! TWA's great new Jetstream\nfleet offers superlative luxury,\nsuperb service on swift non-stop\nflights across the Atlantic between\nNew York and London, Paris,\nLisbon and Rome, coast-to-coast\nin the U.S., and via the Polar Route\nbetween Europe and California.\nOn your very next trip, be sure to\nfly the finest... fly TWA Jetstream!\nSEE YOUR TRAVEL AGENT\nHe'll be glad to make all your res-\nervations via TWA Jetstream ...\narrange for hotel accommodations\neverywhere you go, give you any\ntravel information you require.\nSave time-and money, too. See\nyour Travel Agent before you go!\nFLY TWA\nJETSTREAM\n2001.039.210\nLitho in U.S.A. #5098\n200M\n8-57",
      "TWA\nJETSTREAM\nNEWEST...\nFINEST\nIN THE\nSKIES\nNE\n*Jetstream is a service mark owned exclusively by TWA."
    ],
